data.creator_notes:
He is sweeter than I thought he would be, to be honest.

• He got jealous after seeing you close to another man; his coping method? Sparring;
• You accidently caught him in a compromising situation in a ball;
• (FemPov) Arranged marriage;
• You are finally allowed to return home and he feels conflicted by the idea of you leaving;
• He walked on a servant physically abusing you.
